      "content": "Thanks for the breakdown. That's a good starting point for the diligence memo. \n\nI'm particularly interested in point 5—the tech maturity. I looked briefly at their lab results and the enzyme tech seems robust based on their slide decks. Can you dive deeper into the technical side of things? I want to know if there are any specific technical red flags or stability issues in the actual lab data that we should be aware of before I present this to the committee.",
